WEBVTT

00:25.620 --> 00:30.950
<b>"MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM
THUNDERBOLT"</b>

01:33.700 --> 01:35.830
<b>This is a nice song selection.</b>

01:35.870 --> 01:38.580
<b>Io, pirate radio again?</b>

01:38.620 --> 01:40.660
<b>At least use headphones.</b>

01:40.830 --> 01:42.620
<b>You've got to feel the sound.</b>

01:43.120 --> 01:44.910
<b>The previous broadcast?</b>

01:44.950 --> 01:46.250
<b>This one's good.</b>

01:46.290 --> 01:48.830
<b>Yeah, you got it at a good timing.</b>

01:49.160 --> 01:51.120
<b>Maybe the lightning brings it.</b>

01:51.500 --> 01:53.700
<b>- The Minovsky...
- It's light?</b>

01:54.080 --> 01:54.870
<b>Don't care.</b>

01:54.910 --> 01:57.080
<b>- Copy it for me.
- Right here.</b>

01:57.370 --> 02:00.200
<b>This part is great
just before we sortie.</b>

02:00.250 --> 02:02.040
<b>I know what you mean.</b>

02:03.200 --> 02:04.750
<b>I can see it.</b>

02:04.790 --> 02:07.290
<b>Flying and barely dodging the debris.</b>

02:10.040 --> 02:12.120
<b>The vibration on my butt.</b>

02:12.290 --> 02:15.000
<b>I feel the switches at my fingertips.</b>

02:27.620 --> 02:29.790
<b>They all become my eyes and move.</b>

02:33.540 --> 02:36.250
<b>Can't they improve the air
in the hangar?</b>

02:36.540 --> 02:38.000
<b>It's just your sinuses.</b>

02:38.040 --> 02:39.660
<b>Cornelius, tissues.</b>

02:39.700 --> 02:41.700
<b>Give them back, alright?</b>

02:42.540 --> 02:44.120
<b>- Thanks.
- See you.</b>

02:48.120 --> 02:50.250
<b>Here's the operational objective.</b>

02:50.370 --> 02:54.660
<b>Eliminate the enemy snipers
hiding in our home, Side 4 "Moore".</b>

02:55.540 --> 02:59.330
<b>We've lost over 40 allied
machines this past month.</b>

03:00.040 --> 03:02.250
<b>This Thunderbolt Sector...</b>

03:02.290 --> 03:05.580
<b>We can't forgive the cowards
who destroyed our home.</b>

03:06.250 --> 03:08.790
<b>This war is entering its final stage.</b>

03:09.250 --> 03:13.580
<b>Regaining this sector will
change the tide of the war.</b>

03:14.200 --> 03:16.120
<b>Glory again to Side 4, Moore.</b>

03:16.910 --> 03:19.080
<b>Death to the cowardly Zeon.</b>

03:19.580 --> 03:21.500
<b>The Brotherhood, eh.</b>

03:21.540 --> 03:25.750
<b>Geez. My birthplace
keeps on tying me down.</b>

03:42.370 --> 03:44.790
<b>Free jazz is perfect for Thunderbolt.</b>

03:49.000 --> 03:53.290
<b>I love mobile suits, space, and
the battlefield. It's free here.</b>

04:00.910 --> 04:03.750
<b>Oh no, our positions are obvious.</b>

04:04.040 --> 04:06.700
<b>When they shoot, we'll
trace back their location.</b>

04:10.450 --> 04:13.910
<b>Now, who'll be the unlucky one?</b>

04:21.290 --> 04:22.910
<b>- Who's hit?
- Ensign Io.</b>

04:28.830 --> 04:31.000
<b>Commander... Commander!</b>

04:31.370 --> 04:32.620
<b>Emergency.</b>

04:32.660 --> 04:36.540
<b>Commander hit by beam cannon.
His machine's demolished.</b>

04:36.580 --> 04:38.500
<b>They're sniping from the debris.</b>

04:38.540 --> 04:41.910
<b>Radio won't work with this
Minovsky particle density.</b>

04:41.950 --> 04:43.200
<b>You search, too--</b>

04:44.200 --> 04:45.450
<b>Dave!</b>

04:46.370 --> 04:48.040
<b>Find the enemy sniper!</b>

04:49.040 --> 04:51.290
<b>How can they see us?</b>

04:51.330 --> 04:53.580
<b>The Minovsky particles
are still so dense!</b>

04:53.620 --> 04:55.080
<b>Calculate their positions!</b>

04:55.120 --> 04:58.200
<b>- It's Side 4!
- Attack our home?</b>

05:22.250 --> 05:23.870
<b>My barrel's past its limit.</b>

05:24.370 --> 05:27.120
<b>Daryl will now be sending
orbit prediction data.</b>

05:27.160 --> 05:30.160
<b>Nice, Chief Petty Officer Daryl.
I got the rest.</b>

05:30.830 --> 05:33.290
<b>This'll earn me the Cross.</b>

05:34.950 --> 05:37.160
<b>Bragging to your lady? Or...</b>

05:37.660 --> 05:41.410
<b>Sean, it's complicated
who Ensign Hoover reports to.</b>

05:41.450 --> 05:44.500
<b>Shut up. I'm gonna get them.</b>

05:44.700 --> 05:47.450
<b>Both the Federation and the girl!</b>

05:53.160 --> 05:56.290
<b>Amazing! Is Daryl a clairvoyant?</b>

05:56.330 --> 05:58.330
<b>Or one of those Newtypes?</b>

05:58.540 --> 06:01.580
<b>I'll get commended back home.
Then it's vacation!</b>

06:07.700 --> 06:10.660
<b>Ensign Hoover,
is your machine drifting?</b>

06:10.700 --> 06:14.580
<b>Communication's cutting out.
Please check cable connection.</b>

06:15.370 --> 06:16.330
<b>Really?</b>

06:25.160 --> 06:26.410
<b>Hey.</b>

06:28.450 --> 06:29.410
<b>Hoover!</b>

06:29.450 --> 06:32.450
<b>It's a human.
A Federation normal suit!</b>

06:32.500 --> 06:35.870
<b>Daryl, can you snipe him?
I can't aim from here!</b>

06:35.910 --> 06:37.330
<b>But Hoover is--</b>

06:37.540 --> 06:40.080
<b>He's been shot in the head! You saw!</b>

06:51.700 --> 06:55.200
<b>So the cockpit isn't
that different from Zaku.</b>

06:57.750 --> 07:01.410
<b>Hey, you may be ace snipers,</b>

07:01.450 --> 07:04.000
<b>but your taste in music
is mediocre.</b>

07:04.620 --> 07:06.830
<b>Big talk for a guy who got lucky.</b>

07:06.870 --> 07:10.870
<b>No wonder a guy with fake legs
sneakily shoots from far away.</b>

07:13.500 --> 07:15.250
<b>Making fun of my legs?</b>

07:15.450 --> 07:18.040
<b>Now I know your firing location.</b>

07:18.080 --> 07:20.160
<b>I'll cruise home via your blind spots.</b>

07:20.660 --> 07:22.700
<b>You won't escape next time.</b>

07:22.750 --> 07:24.870
<b>I'll get you for sure.</b>

07:25.080 --> 07:27.500
<b>I'm Chief Petty Officer Daryl Lorenz.</b>

07:27.540 --> 07:29.660
<b>I'll keep my eye on you.</b>

07:30.120 --> 07:32.620
<b>I'm Ensign Io Fleming.</b>

07:32.660 --> 07:35.790
<b>When you hear jazz,
it means I'm coming.</b>

08:18.870 --> 08:21.500
<b>Patti Page, right? "Tennessee Waltz".</b>

08:21.540 --> 08:23.040
<b>You heard?</b>

08:23.080 --> 08:24.950
<b>I like the Royal Teens.</b>

08:25.000 --> 08:26.620
<b>"Short Shorts"?</b>

08:27.040 --> 08:28.700
<b>No, this.</b>

08:28.910 --> 08:30.000
<b>I see.</b>

08:30.040 --> 08:31.870
<b>If you're interested, okay?</b>

08:32.540 --> 08:33.540
<b>We'll see.</b>

08:39.620 --> 08:42.540
<b>24 sortied, and this
is all that's left?</b>

08:42.870 --> 08:45.540
<b>That's a loser's operation for you.</b>

09:02.620 --> 09:05.580
<b>To the maintenance hangar.
Top priority!</b>

09:09.500 --> 09:10.790
<b>Io!</b>

09:15.870 --> 09:19.160
<b>Ensign Io Fleming, reporting in.</b>

09:29.870 --> 09:32.500
<b>Never did like the guy...</b>

09:32.540 --> 09:34.160
<b>Acting like a playboy.</b>

09:36.370 --> 09:38.950
<b>Take the body to the Reuse Lab.</b>

09:39.120 --> 09:42.620
<b>I miraculously found it.
I want to send him to his family.</b>

09:43.000 --> 09:45.080
<b>Get the data from his arm first.</b>

09:45.290 --> 09:47.160
<b>A guinea pig even in death?</b>

09:47.450 --> 09:50.450
<b>It's because of that data
that you can fight, right?</b>

09:50.540 --> 09:52.660
<b>Professor Karla, the body is...</b>

09:55.750 --> 09:56.790
<b>Professor?</b>

10:16.540 --> 10:18.450
<b>Major damage, 4.
Minor damage, 6.</b>

10:18.500 --> 10:20.830
<b>Cockpit block only, 5.
Lost, 9.</b>

10:21.330 --> 10:22.370
<b>I see.</b>

10:24.830 --> 10:29.790
<b>We're gathering data from the
Rick Dom the Ensign seized.</b>

10:30.000 --> 10:33.200
<b>We may get their deployment
and movement patterns.</b>

10:33.410 --> 10:34.410
<b>I see.</b>

10:34.450 --> 10:38.700
<b>We're also loading that item
into the container.</b>

10:38.750 --> 10:41.750
<b>The mechanics we dispatched
have returned along with it,</b>

10:41.830 --> 10:44.330
<b>so they can test it immediately.</b>

10:44.370 --> 10:46.000
<b>Who'll use it?</b>

10:46.080 --> 10:48.500
<b>Who else but Ensign Io?</b>

10:48.540 --> 10:49.790
<b>You're right...</b>

10:50.120 --> 10:51.790
<b>Shall I give the order?</b>

10:52.450 --> 10:55.040
<b>No, I'll tell him.</b>

11:10.370 --> 11:12.450
<b>A prototype mobile suit.</b>

11:12.750 --> 11:15.410
<b>The Moore Brotherhood
paid the Federation?</b>

11:16.120 --> 11:20.620
<b>Everyone who outranked you
died in the last operation.</b>

11:20.700 --> 11:21.700
<b>Otherwise...</b>

11:21.750 --> 11:25.660
<b>I guess we've both advanced
because our superiors died.</b>

11:25.700 --> 11:27.160
<b>Right, Acting Captain?</b>

11:38.370 --> 11:42.160
<b>Unhand me, Ensign Io Fleming.
Captain's orders.</b>

11:43.620 --> 11:45.040
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

11:50.700 --> 11:52.330
<b>I see.</b>

11:52.370 --> 11:54.040
<b>A surprise, right?</b>

11:55.200 --> 11:56.370
<b>Where's the captain?</b>

11:56.410 --> 11:58.950
<b>Quality time with her man.</b>

11:59.620 --> 12:03.830
<b>A captain because she's an elite.
What a privileged class.</b>

12:03.870 --> 12:06.580
<b>I heard Io's getting the prototype.</b>

12:06.620 --> 12:09.370
<b>He's the son of Moore's leader, too.</b>

12:09.620 --> 12:14.660
<b>The incompetent elite let
Zeon invade and destroy our home.</b>

12:14.700 --> 12:18.200
<b>But they're perfect
as human sacrifices.</b>

12:18.540 --> 12:21.870
<b>The young heroes
who die for their ideals.</b>

12:22.160 --> 12:27.330
<b>Those with sinful lineages can be
Moore Brotherhood propaganda.</b>

12:28.370 --> 12:30.580
<b>That's what the Gundam's for.</b>

12:33.080 --> 12:35.290
<b>I won't love you anymore.</b>

12:35.910 --> 12:38.450
<b>Then I can order you to go and die.</b>

12:38.500 --> 12:42.750
<b>That's right, Claudia.
Give me an order to sortie.</b>

12:42.910 --> 12:44.540
<b>I'm captivated...</b>

12:44.870 --> 12:49.250
<b>by these demon mobile suits
that glitter in battle.</b>

13:02.700 --> 13:05.290
<b>I heard the mid-combat
communication records.</b>

13:06.160 --> 13:08.910
<b>The Federation pilot
who killed Hoover...</b>

13:09.410 --> 13:12.410
<b>When you hear jazz,
that means he's coming, right?</b>

13:12.950 --> 13:13.910
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:15.620 --> 13:17.450
<b>Please, Daryl.</b>

13:17.870 --> 13:20.200
<b>You must kill him.</b>

13:21.370 --> 13:24.620
<b>An ace like you
can do that, right?</b>

13:35.620 --> 13:39.540
<b>Professor Karla,
can I get some painkillers?</b>

13:40.410 --> 13:42.330
<b>The legs you gave me...</b>

13:43.500 --> 13:45.910
<b>they hurt really bad tonight.</b>

13:50.830 --> 13:54.910
<b>Confirm the sniper rotation
we got from the Rick Dom.</b>

13:54.950 --> 13:58.700
<b>You got that? Just do it as
an extension of a test flight.</b>

14:00.790 --> 14:02.330
<b>Cornelius, tissues.</b>

14:02.750 --> 14:04.040
<b>Here you go.</b>

14:04.200 --> 14:06.330
<b>Some music too, partner.</b>

14:06.370 --> 14:07.160
<b>Okay.</b>

14:15.450 --> 14:16.910
<b>Amazing.</b>

14:17.370 --> 14:19.500
<b>It's beyond comparison.</b>

14:19.540 --> 14:22.000
<b>This is... Gundam.</b>

14:43.250 --> 14:45.040
<b>This is the best!</b>

14:45.200 --> 14:47.540
<b>This is the power I've wanted!</b>

14:53.910 --> 14:55.500
<b>Gundam...</b>

14:55.870 --> 14:58.000
<b>Become my power.</b>

15:04.160 --> 15:05.660
<b>It dodged?</b>

15:05.790 --> 15:06.750
<b>No way!</b>

15:09.790 --> 15:12.750
<b>Darn it. What's going on?</b>

15:37.700 --> 15:38.750
<b>It's jazz.</b>

15:39.040 --> 15:41.370
<b>3 Zakus shot down.</b>

15:41.410 --> 15:44.410
<b>All the Big Gun attacks were dodged.</b>

15:44.870 --> 15:48.000
<b>A high-mobility mobile suit
with heavy armor.</b>

15:48.040 --> 15:53.330
<b>This machine is a troubling enemy
for our Living Dead Division.</b>

15:56.580 --> 15:57.580
<b>The Federation's...</b>

15:58.000 --> 15:59.080
<b>Gundam.</b>

16:04.290 --> 16:06.040
<b>It's him.</b>
